2026-07-27T14:43:55.0186991Z [36;1m# Inference uses an empty user Makevars so we always read the pristine[0m
2026-07-27T14:43:55.0187427Z [36;1m# Makeconf defaults, never a value we just wrote.[0m
2026-07-27T14:43:55.0187858Z [36;1m# Note: the versioned switches (CXX11..CXX23) intentionally come out as[0m
